// A formatted date, as a LOCAL jstring the caller reads and releases.
// ---- FacetPopup ----------------------------------------------------------------
// The items arrive ONE AT A TIME: an ArrayAdapter takes a List and there is no
// array door from C+, so the list is accumulated on the Java side between
// `begin` and `commit`.

